    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Buli ku nkomerero y'emyaka omusanvu, mwidha kusonighanga abantu amabandha ge mubabandha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eno n'ensambo ye munaakikolangamu: Kiisi anaabanga ni Muisiraeli mwine y'abandha, aidha kumusonighanga kye yamuwola. Atagezangaku kumubandha, kuba Musengwa Katonda mwene n'alagiire ekisonigho ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munaabanga ba idembe okusasuza omusenze kye mumubandha. Aye Muisiraeli munaimwe munaakimulekeranga bulekere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kubaghanga enkabi mu nsi y'ali kubagha okutwala, ebe obutaka bwaimwe. Era mu imwe timuubengamu mwavu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bwe munaawuliranga Musengwa Katonda waimwe by'akoba, ni mutuukiriza ebiragiro bye n'obwegendereza, bye ndi kubagha olwaleero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda aidha kubaghanga enkabi nga bwe yasuubiza. Mwidha kuwolanga amaghanga kamaala, aye imwe timwidha kugeewolangaku. Mwidha kufuganga amaghanga kamaala, aye imwe tigaidha kubafuganga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwe ghanaabangagho Muisiraeli munaimwe omwavu ng'ali mu kindi ku bibuga byaimwe, mu nsi Musengwa Katonda waimwe y'ali kubagha, muteerowoozangaku mwenka ni muloba kumulaadha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 25:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye mumugemerwenga ekivunika, mumuwolenga byonabyona by'anaabanga nga yeetaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalobanga kumuwola nga mukoba muti kuba omwaka ogwomusanvu ogw'okusoniyiramu amabandha guli kumpi okutuuka, mube nga timusasulwa bye mubandha. Mutaganhanga ndowooza mbi eyo kwingira mu myoyo gyaimwe. Bwe munaalobanga okumuwola, memale n'alirira Musengwa Katonda okubavunaana, olwo mwidha kubanga nga muli n'omusango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumughenga na mwoyo mulala aghazira kukakibwa. Olwo Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kubaghanga enkabi mu byonabyona bye munaakolanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buliidho ghaidha kubanga nga ghaligho Abaisiraeli abaavu n'abali mu bwetaavu mu nsi. Kyenva ni mbalagira nti mutalobanga kubayamba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 14:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoa 12:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Bwe bakuguzanga Muheburayi mwino ng'omwiru, k'abe musaadha oba mukazi, memale n'akugheereza okumala emyaka omukaaga, mu mwaka ogwomusanvu oidhanga kumuleka agolole nga wa idembe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.39+LEV.25.40+LEV.25.41+LEV.25.42+LEV.25.43+LEV.25.44+LEV.25.45+LEV.25.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 25:39-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era bw'onaamalanga okumuleka okugolola nga wa idembe, otamulekanga kuja buje atyo ng'azira kantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oidha kumughanga n'omwoyo omugabi, ng'otoola ku ntaama dho, ni ku mbuzi dho, ni ku mere yo ey'empeke, ni ku mwenge gwo ogw'emizabbibu. Musengwa Katonda wo y'anaakomyanga okukugha ebingi, weena y'onaakomyanga okugha omuntu oyo ebingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhukire nga mwali bairu mu Misiri, Musengwa Katonda waimwe yaabanunula. Kyenva ndi kubagha ekiragiro ekyo mpegaano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye omwiru asobola okuba nga tayenda kukuvaaku, kuba akugonza iwe n'ab'omu maka go, era nga mumativu okusigala n'iwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwo oidha kugemanga olugera olusongovu omufuwule kutu owundi ng'ali gha lwigi, olwo abeerenga irala mwiru wo enaku dhoonadhoona. N'omwiru wo omukazi yeena otyo bw'onaamubisanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omwiru wo bw'anaabanga nga tayenze kusigala n'iwe, otawuliranga mule bubi ng'omulese okugolola nga wa idembe. Kuba anaabanga ng'akukoleire emyaka mukaaga, ng'egyo n'emirimo gy'okubisaamu emikuzi ebiri mu egyo omukozi akolera empeera gy'akola. Bw'onaakolanga otyo, Musengwa Katonda wo aidha kukughanga enkabi mu byonabyona by'onaakolanga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaakoba Abaisiraeli ati: “Mwawulenga ente dhaimwe enume, n'entaama dhaimwe, n'embuzi dhaimwe, edhizaalibwa mu luzaalo olusooka, dhibenga dha Musengwa Katonda waimwe. Ente edho mutadhikozesanga mirimo, n'entaama edho mutadhisalangaku buviiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 13:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye buli mwaka, imwe n'ab'omu maka gaimwe, munaalyanga ensolo edho nga muli mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda waimwe, mu kifo ekyo ky'aliba ng'alonzeegho okumusinzizangamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ensolo edho bwe dhinaabangaku ekikyamu, nga nema, oba nga ntulu, oba nga dhiriku ekikyamu ekindi kyonakyona, timuudhighengayo eri Musengwa Katonda waimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwidhanga kudhiriira mu bibuga byaimwe. Abalongoofu n'abatali balongoofu banaabanga ba idembe okudhiryaku, ng'oti ni bwe balya ku mpuuli n'empongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
